        },
        {
            "block_label": "table",
            "block_content": "<table><tr><td>Name</td><td>Protocol</td><td>Port number</td><td>Description</td></tr><tr><td>V2G_SRC_TCP_DATA</td><td>TCP(unicast)</td><td>Port number in the range of Dynamic Ports (49152-65535) as defined in IETF RFC 6335.</td><td>V2GTP source port at a Primary Actor (e.g. EVCC) that implements the V2GTP protocol.</td></tr><tr><td>V2G_DST_TCP_DATA</td><td>TCP (unicast)</td><td>Port number at V2GTP entity providing a V2GTP destination port number in the range of Dynamic Ports (49152-65535) as defined in IETF RFC 6335. For an SECC it will be dynamically assigned by the SDP mechanism (see 7.10.1)</td><td>V2GTP destination port at a Primary Actor (e.g. SECC)</td></tr></table>",
            "block_bbox": [
